 <div class="faqcol">
 <div class="qa rv open"><button aria-expanded="true">Can a below threshold lead be revived later?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, it moves to long term nurture rather than being dropped.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">How are two prospects wanting the same city handled?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>The territory is reserved provisionally for the active discussion, preventing double selling.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">What happens automatically when an agreement is signed?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>The lead converts to a franchisee record, a campus is created, and royalty terms are recorded.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can we track a multi unit franchisee’s overall performance in one place?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, a single role scoped view spans all of their territories.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Is historic enquiry data usable after setup?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, it can be imported and retrospectively matched to territories, often revealing demand you haven’t yet sold.</p></div></div></div>
 </div>
