<body>
<div class="hb">
<section class="p-hero" id="hero">
 <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80')"></i><i style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504639725590-34d0984388bd?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format')"></i><i style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80')"></i></div>
 <div class="hero-veil"></div><div class="patt patt--soft"></div>
 <div class="box hero-in">
 <div class="hero-card rv rv--l">
 <div class="pp-crumb"><a href="https://www.elitetechcorp.com/franchise-management-system/preschool-franchise/">Zoho for Preschool Franchise</a> <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Zoho Books</div>
 <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pp-badge"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt="">Bill</span></div>
 <h1 class="h1">Preschool Franchise Royalty Billing, Fully Automated.</h1>
 <p class="lede">Your revenue isn’t tuition, it’s a one time preschool franchise fee and a recurring royalty calculated from each campus’s reported revenue. Zoho Books turns that calculation into an automatic monthly event instead of a manual reconstruction exercise.</p>
 <div class="btnrow" style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn btn--g" href="https://elitemeetings.elitetechcorp.com/#/technical-consultations" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Zoho Books Demo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a class="btn btn--o" href="#flow">See the flow</a></div>
 </div>
 <div class="hero-video rv rv--r"><div class="hv-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/i-x2ptO1B_o?rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1" title="Zoho Books for Preschool Franchise" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>
 </div>
 </section><section class="sec sec--white" id="summary"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>What it does</em></div><h2 class="">Zoho Books, built for<br><span class="hl">your preschool franchise network</span></h2><p class="lede">Your revenue isn’t tuition, it’s a one time preschool franchise fee and a recurring royalty calculated from each campus’s reported revenue.</p></div>
 <div class="pp-points st"><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">01</span><p>Invoices the one time franchise fee automatically the moment an agreement is signed in CRM.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">02</span><p>Records royalty rules, percentage, minimum guarantee, billing frequency, individually per franchisee, since terms often differ across signing generations.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">03</span><p>Calculates monthly royalty automatically from declared or actual campus revenue, applying the minimum guarantee when it’s higher.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">04</span><p>Generates recurring invoices across the entire network on the same billing cycle, with the calculation basis shown transparently.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">05</span><p>Tracks receivables ageing network wide, surfacing persistent late payers as an operational issue rather than a surprise.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">06</span><p>Bills centrally supplied materials, curriculum kits, uniforms, signage, through the same ledger as royalty.</p></div></div>
 </div></section>
<section class="sec sec--alt" id="flow"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Quick flow · the journey</em></div><h2 class="">How Zoho Books moves a<br><span class="hl">franchise prospect forward</span></h2><p class="lede">The full user journey, then the exact workflow with every decision point, drawn from the Zoho Suite for Preschool Franchises specification.</p></div>
 <div class="pj-rail"><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">1</span><div><h4>Signature confirmed</h4><p>A completion webhook is received automatically from Zoho Sign once the agreement is signed.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">2</span><div><h4>Franchise fee invoiced</h4><p>The one time fee is generated and sent immediately, with payment terms as specified in the agreement.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">3</span><div><h4>Royalty rule set</h4><p>Percentage, minimum guarantee, and billing frequency are recorded specifically for that franchisee.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">4</span><div><h4>Revenue declared</h4><p>Monthly campus revenue is reported or derived automatically from the franchisee’s own books.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">5</span><div><h4>Branch point</h4><p>If declared revenue falls below the agreed minimum guarantee, that higher amount is billed instead; otherwise, the percentage based calculation applies.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">6</span><div><h4>Invoice generated</h4><p>The recurring royalty invoice is issued with the calculation basis shown clearly to the franchisee.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">7</span><div><h4>Branch point</h4><p>Payment received on time is recorded and receivables updated; overdue payment triggers the escalation process defined in your franchise agreement.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">8</span><div><h4>Network reporting</h4><p>Royalty realization, receivables ageing, and revenue per territory are all visible centrally, separate from campus level tuition.</p></div></div></div>
 <div class="wf-wrap rv"><div class="wf-head"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><b>Zoho Books · franchise workflow</b></div><div class="wf"><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">1</span><div><b>Franchise fee invoiced</b><small>Generated automatically the moment the agreement is signed.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">2</span><div><b>Royalty terms set</b><small>Percentage and minimum guarantee recorded per franchisee.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">3</span><div><b>Monthly royalty billed</b><small>Calculated automatically from declared campus revenue.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">4</span><div><b>Receivables tracked</b><small>Aged and visible across the entire franchise network.</small></div></div></div></div>
 <div class="pj-parent rv"><i class="fa-solid fa-child-reaching"></i><p><b>And for a parent enquiry?</b> Tuition is the franchisee’s revenue, not yours. Books tracks the franchise fee, the royalty stream and centrally supplied materials. Campus level fee collection from parents stays entirely with the campus, as it should.</p></div>
</div></section><section class="sec sec--white" id="usecases"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Use cases</em></div><h2 class="">Where Zoho Books<br><span class="hl">earns its place in preschool franchising</span></h2></div>
 <div class="uc-grid st"><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607705703571-c5a8695f18f6?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Month end in an hour</h4><p>Twenty royalty invoices calculated automatically, with your finance team reviewing only genuine exceptions.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608222351212-18fe0ec7b13b?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Different terms, no memory required</h4><p>Early franchisees on legacy royalty rates are handled correctly without anyone tracking exceptions manually.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164574572-cb89e39749b4?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Spotting under declared revenue</h4><p>Comparing declared revenue against enrollment data from CRM surfaces discrepancies while they’re still a conversation, not a dispute.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504639725590-34d0984388bd?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Marketing fund transparency</h4><p>Contributions in and spend out are tracked separately, turning a recurring franchisee question into a simple report.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608222351212-18fe0ec7b13b?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Selling accounting as part of the franchise package</h4><p>Offering new franchisees a preconfigured Books setup improves the reliability of the revenue figures you bill against from day one.</p></div></article></div>
 </div></section><section class="sec sec--alt" id="comparison"><div class="box">
