 <div class="pp-roi rv" style="margin-top:66px"><div class="pp-roi-tx"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Return on investment</em></div><h2>Royalty is your revenue. Reconstructing it by hand every month is not a finance process, it is a risk.</h2><p class="lede">Legacy franchisees on old rates, minimum guarantees that only apply in weak months, materials billed on a different cycle. Held in one person’s head, every one of those is an error waiting to become an awkward conversation. Held as configuration, none of them are.</p></div><div class="pp-roi-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8e8b4b6d7e3?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="A finance desk with calculator, ledger and reports" loading="lazy"></div></div>
