 <div class="faqcol">
 <div class="qa rv open"><button aria-expanded="true">Can royalty be billed on something other than revenue?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, per student, flat monthly, or tiered, configured to your agreement.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">What if a franchisee already uses their own accounting system?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Declared revenue can be submitted through a structured monthly form or import.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Is the marketing fund tracked separately?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, contributions in and spend out are both visible as a report.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">How are overdue royalty payments escalated?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>The process defined in your franchise agreement triggers automatically, with full payment history attached.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can different franchisees have completely different royalty percentages?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, terms are stored individually per franchisee record.</p></div></div></div>
 </div>
