 <div class="pp-roi rv" style="margin-top:66px"><div class="pp-roi-tx"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Return on investment</em></div><h2>The prospect who says “not this year” is not a lost lead. They are next year’s signature, if anything still reaches them.</h2><p class="lede">Franchise sales fail quietly. A prospect told their city was unavailable eighteen months ago will never check back on their own. An automatic territory release alert costs nothing to send and revives a lead that was, until that moment, worth zero.</p></div><div class="pp-roi-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="Engagement analytics displayed on a laptop screen" loading="lazy"></div></div>
