<section class="sec sec--alt" id="faq">
 <div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head center rv" style="margin-bottom:40px"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>FAQ</em></div><h2 class="">Zoho Campaigns for preschool franchises,<br><span class="hl">answered</span></h2><p class="lede">Straight answers about Zoho Campaigns for preschool franchise brands.</p></div>
 <div class="faqcol">
 <div class="qa rv open"><button aria-expanded="true">Won’t a long sequence annoy a fast moving investor?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>No, a prospect who moves quickly skips ahead automatically based on pipeline stage.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">How are cold leads handled?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>They move to a lighter quarterly reengagement track rather than being dropped.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can we track which content actually drives conversions?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, every send’s engagement is scored back onto the CRM lead.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">What happens when a prospect requests a territory that’s already sold?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>They’re offered nearby alternatives and added to that new territory’s alert list.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can franchise development manually override the sequence for a specific prospect?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, any lead can be moved directly to a different stage or pulled out for personal outreach.</p></div></div></div>
 </div>
</section>
