<body>
<div class="hb">
<section class="p-hero" id="hero">
 <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80')"></i><i style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80')"></i><i style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553877522-43269d4ea984?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80')"></i></div>
 <div class="hero-veil"></div><div class="patt patt--soft"></div>
 <div class="box hero-in">
 <div class="hero-card rv rv--l">
 <div class="pp-crumb"><a href="https://www.elitetechcorp.com/franchise-management-system/preschool-franchise/">Zoho for Preschool Franchise</a> <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Zoho SalesIQ</div>
 <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pp-badge"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/salesiq.svg" alt="">Converse</span></div>
 <h1 class="h1">The First Question a Serious Preschool Franchise Investor Actually Wants Answered.</h1>
 <p class="lede">Zoho SalesIQ opens preschool franchise conversations with territory availability, not a generic greeting, qualifying investment readiness live in chat and booking discovery calls before a prospect has time to lose interest.</p>
 <div class="btnrow" style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn btn--g" href="https://elitemeetings.elitetechcorp.com/#/technical-consultations" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Zoho SalesIQ Demo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a class="btn btn--o" href="#flow">See the flow</a></div>
 </div>
 <div class="hero-video rv rv--r"><div class="hv-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/FzRY6-aYMqA?rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1" title="Zoho SalesIQ for Preschool Franchise" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>
 </div>
 </section><section class="sec sec--white" id="summary"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>What it does</em></div><h2 class="">Zoho SalesIQ, built for<br><span class="hl">your preschool franchise network</span></h2><p class="lede">Zoho SalesIQ opens preschool franchise conversations with territory availability, not a generic greeting, qualifying investment readiness live in chat and booking discovery calls before a prospect has time to lose interest.</p></div>
 <div class="pp-points st"><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">01</span><p>Opens every franchise page conversation with a direct question about the city or region under consideration.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">02</span><p>Checks live territory availability inside the chat window itself, rather than deferring to a follow up call.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">03</span><p>Qualifies investment capacity, timeline, and business background through a short, structured conversation flow.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">04</span><p>Books discovery calls directly into franchise development’s calendar without leaving the chat.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">05</span><p>Escalates high scoring prospects to an immediate live handover during business hours.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">06</span><p>Identifies itself clearly as an automated assistant and offers a human handover early, avoiding any pretense.</p></div></div>
 </div></section>
<section class="sec sec--alt" id="flow"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Quick flow · the journey</em></div><h2 class="">How Zoho SalesIQ moves a<br><span class="hl">franchise prospect forward</span></h2><p class="lede">The full user journey, then the exact workflow with every decision point, drawn from the Zoho Suite for Preschool Franchises specification.</p></div>
 <div class="pj-rail"><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">1</span><div><h4>Landing</h4><p>A prospect visits the franchise opportunity page, or the bot proactively reaches out based on browsing behaviour.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">2</span><div><h4>Opening question</h4><p>The bot asks which city or region they’re considering.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">3</span><div><h4>Live availability check</h4><p>The requested territory is checked instantly against the live map inside the chat.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">4</span><div><h4>Branch point</h4><p>If available, the visitor gets immediate confirmation; if not, nearby open territories are suggested instead.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">5</span><div><h4>Qualification</h4><p>Investment capacity band, timeline, and prior business experience are captured through natural conversation.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">6</span><div><h4>Real answers given</h4><p>Questions about investment range, included support, and typical launch timeline are answered directly, not deferred.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">7</span><div><h4>Intent scoring</h4><p>The conversation’s overall quality sets a lead priority score automatically.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">8</span><div><h4>Branch point</h4><p>A high scoring prospect during business hours is offered immediate live handover; others are queued for standard follow up.</p></div></div><div class="pj-step rv"><span class="pj-dot">9</span><div><h4>Lead creation</h4><p>The full transcript and qualification data are attached to a new CRM record either way.</p></div></div></div>
 <div class="wf-wrap rv"><div class="wf-head"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/salesiq.svg" alt=""><b>Zoho SalesIQ · franchise workflow</b></div><div class="wf"><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">1</span><div><b>Chat opens with territory question</b><small>Live availability checked inside the conversation.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">2</span><div><b>Prospect qualified</b><small>Investment capacity, timeline, and background captured.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">3</span><div><b>Discovery call booked</b><small>Or an immediate live handover for high intent visitors.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">4</span><div><b>Lead created</b><small>Full transcript and qualification data attached in CRM.</small></div></div></div></div>
 <div class="pj-parent rv"><i class="fa-solid fa-child-reaching"></i><p><b>And for a parent enquiry?</b> A parent gets a separate, much shorter flow. Which city are you in? Here is your nearest campus. We have let them know. Two exchanges, then a clean handoff, no qualification, no scoring, no follow up queue.</p></div>
</div></section><section class="sec sec--white" id="usecases"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Use cases</em></div><h2 class="">Where Zoho SalesIQ<br><span class="hl">earns its place in preschool franchising</span></h2></div>
 <div class="uc-grid st"><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553775282-20af80779df7?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Out of hours capture</h4><p>Investors researching franchises on a Sunday get qualified and routed overnight, so your team opens Monday with structured leads, not missed calls.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557804506-669a67965ba0?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Rewarding high intent</h4><p>A visitor who has viewed the unit economics page four times this week triggers a proactive chat invitation referencing territory availability directly.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164574572-cb89e39749b4?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Answering the real question immediately</h4><p>Investment range, support included, and typical timeline to opening are answered live in chat.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557804506-669a67965ba0?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Multilingual first contact</h4><p>Opening in a regional language and switching to English on request meaningfully lifts engagement in local markets.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Reducing no show discovery calls</h4><p>Because qualification happens before booking, the calls that do get scheduled are with prospects who’ve already shown genuine, specific interest.</p></div></article></div>
 </div></section><section class="sec sec--alt" id="comparison"><div class="box">
