 <div class="pp-roi rv" style="margin-top:66px"><div class="pp-roi-tx"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Return on investment</em></div><h2>The investor researching franchises at 11pm on a Sunday is the most serious one you will meet all week.</h2><p class="lede">They will not fill in a form and wait three days. They want to know whether their city is open, what the investment is, and how long it takes. Answer those three questions live and the conversation continues. Defer them and it ends.</p></div><div class="pp-roi-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="A world map used for territory planning" loading="lazy"></div></div>
