 <div class="faqcol">
 <div class="qa rv open"><button aria-expanded="true">Can it answer detailed investment questions?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, investment range, support, and timeline are core to the franchise chat flow.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">What happens with a highly qualified prospect during business hours?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>They’re offered an immediate live handover to your team.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Does chat data feed directly into CRM?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, leads and transcripts are created automatically in the franchise pipeline.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Will the bot ever pretend to be a live agent?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>No, it always identifies itself as an assistant and offers a human handover early.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can it operate across WhatsApp or Instagram as well?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, with the same territory first opening and routing logic applied consistently.</p></div></div></div>
 </div>
