 <div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head center rv" style="margin-bottom:40px"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>FAQ</em></div><h2 class="">Zoho Sign for preschool franchises,<br><span class="hl">answered</span></h2><p class="lede">Straight answers about Zoho Sign for preschool franchise brands.</p></div>
 <div class="faqcol">
 <div class="qa rv open"><button aria-expanded="true">Are digital signatures valid for franchise agreements in India?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, under the IT Act, subject to conditions your legal counsel should confirm.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can a prospect negotiate terms after receiving the agreement?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Negotiation happens before issue, approvals ensure what’s sent has already been agreed internally.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can historical agreements be added to the system?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, uploaded and indexed with their term and renewal dates.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">What happens if a signatory rejects the agreement?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>It’s flagged immediately and returned for review rather than silently expiring.</p></div></div></div><div class="qa rv"><button aria-expanded="false">Can we require Aadhaar based eSign for certain documents?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes, both standard electronic signatures and Aadhaar based eSign are supported depending on what your legal counsel specifies.</p></div></div></div>
 </div>
</section>
