 </section><section class="sec sec--white" id="summary"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>What it does</em></div><h2 class="">Zoho Social, built for<br><span class="hl">your preschool franchise network</span></h2><p class="lede">Zoho Social converts your preschool brand’s social presence into a structured franchise acquisition channel, territory news, franchisee success stories, and expansion updates published on a deliberate calendar, with every resulting enquiry captured, tagged, and delivered straight into your franchise sales pipeline.</p></div>
 <div class="pp-points st"><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">01</span><p>Publishes territory availability announcements, franchisee success stories, and unit economics explainers on a dedicated content calendar.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">02</span><p>Runs franchise opportunity content on brand level channels and dedicated franchise only handles or LinkedIn pages.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">03</span><p>Automatically tags investment related comments and DMs as franchise enquiries, without manual monitoring.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">04</span><p>Pushes every tagged enquiry directly into the franchise pipeline in CRM, never mixed with any other lead type.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">05</span><p>Reports content performance against pipeline value generated, not likes, shares, or reach.</p></div><div class="pp-point"><span class="pp-pn">06</span><p>Supports expo and discovery day promotion as a distinct content category with its own performance tracking.</p></div></div>
 </div></section>
<section class="sec sec--alt" id="flow"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Quick flow · the journey</em></div><h2 class="">How Zoho Social moves a<br><span class="hl">franchise prospect forward</span></h2><p class="lede">The full user journey, then the exact workflow with every decision point, drawn from the Zoho Suite for Preschool Franchises specification.</p></div>
 <div class="pj-grid st"><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">01</span><h4>Discovery</h4><p>A prospect sees a territory availability post, franchisee success story, or expansion update on a brand or franchise opportunity channel.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">02</span><h4>Engagement</h4><p>They like, share, or start reading more about the opportunity, often browsing several posts across a few days.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">03</span><h4>Expressed interest</h4><p>They comment or send a direct message asking about investment amount, availability, or how to get started.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">04</span><h4>Automatic detection</h4><p>The system scans the message for franchise intent signals and tags it as a franchise enquiry rather than general engagement.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">05</span><h4>Lead creation</h4><p>A franchise lead record is created automatically in CRM, carrying the source post, channel, and territory context.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">06</span><h4>Notification</h4><p>Franchise development receives an immediate alert with the enquiry and its background attached.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">07</span><h4>First outreach</h4><p>The sales team makes contact, referencing the exact post or story that sparked the enquiry.</p></div><div class="pj-tile"><span class="pj-n">08</span><h4>Nurture continuation</h4><p>If the prospect isn’t ready to move forward immediately, they flow into a long term Zoho Campaigns sequence for ongoing engagement.</p></div></div>
 <div class="wf-wrap rv"><div class="wf-head"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><b>Zoho Social · franchise workflow</b></div><div class="wf"><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">1</span><div><b>Territory post published</b><small>Live across brand and franchise opportunity channels.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">2</span><div><b>Engagement tracked</b><small>Comments and DMs monitored in one unified inbox.</small></div></div><div class="wf-line"></div><div class="wf-node rv"><span class="wf-nn">3</span><div><b>Franchise enquiry tagged</b><small>Investment interest flagged and sent to CRM.</small></div></div></div></div>
 <div class="pj-parent rv"><i class="fa-solid fa-child-reaching"></i><p><b>And for a parent enquiry?</b> General brand posts still serve parents, but no admission pipeline runs from Social. A comment asking about fees or timings is answered and pointed at the “Find a Campus” page, nothing is created on your side, and nothing is chased.</p></div>
</div></section><section class="sec sec--white" id="usecases"><div class="box">
 <div class="sec-head rv"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Use cases</em></div><h2 class="">Where Zoho Social<br><span class="hl">earns its place in preschool franchising</span></h2></div>
 <div class="uc-grid st"><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551434678-e076c223a692?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Selling a territory before you’ve built the case</h4><p>A single franchisee testimonial video can outperform ten inspirational posts, Social’s attribution shows exactly which content generates qualified enquiries.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164574572-cb89e39749b4?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Running multiple territory campaigns at once</h4><p>Three cities open for franchising this quarter each get their own tagged content stream, with zero overlap between conversations.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551434678-e076c223a692?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Recovering the enquiry hiding in a comment</h4><p>A “how do I franchise this?” comment under a success story is captured and converted into a lead automatically.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544776193-352d25ca82cd?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Building investor confidence before a call</h4><p>A steady stream of franchisee wins and expansion news gives a prospect real evidence before they ever speak to your team.</p></div></article><article class="uc-card"><div class="uc-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="uc-tx"><h4>Coordinating expo promotion</h4><p>Pre event posts drive booth traffic, and post event follow up content keeps momentum going with attendees who didn’t convert on the spot.</p></div></article></div>
