 <div class="pp-roi rv" style="margin-top:66px"><div class="pp-roi-tx"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Return on investment</em></div><h2>Social is the cheapest place a franchise enquiry can start, and the easiest place to lose one.</h2><p class="lede">A “how do I franchise this?” comment costs nothing to receive and everything to miss. The return here isn’t reach; it’s the number of investment intent conversations that reach a human instead of scrolling past into the archive.</p></div><div class="pp-roi-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547621008-d6d6d2e28e81?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format" alt="Printed performance charts on a desk" loading="lazy"></div></div>
