 <div class="pp-roi rv" style="margin-top:66px"><div class="pp-roi-tx"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="bundle-mark"><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/social.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/crm.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/books.svg" alt=""><img onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.zohowebstatic.com/sites/zweb/images/productlogos/desk.svg" alt=""><b>Elite Tech Corp</b></span><em>Return on investment</em></div><h2>A test that halves your enquiries and doubles your discovery calls is a test you should ship.</h2><p class="lede">Franchise page traffic is small, so the goal is never volume. Publishing an honest investment range filters out the curious and concentrates what remains. Measured on form fills, that looks like a failure. Measured on pipeline value, it is the best change you will make this year.</p></div><div class="pp-roi-img"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.style.opacity='0'" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=800&h=600&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80" alt="A performance comparison report on a desk" loading="lazy"></div></div>
